# `provenance/*` not `provenance/`: file-level glob lets the negation below
# take effect (git ignores everything inside an ignored *directory* even with
# a `!` rule, but allows un-ignoring with a file glob).
provenance/*
# Exception: track the semver-tagged baseline bundles produced by the
# `freeze_baseline_provenance` rule so collaborators can verify any local copy
# of the per-rule provenance JSONs against a frozen citable record.
!provenance/baseline_*.json

